      "value": "Adding to this, some wold teleport either do not work, or will even send you FAR beyond the world origin, causing major performance and graphical floating point issues.\n\nA fix for this should be implemented in the next open beta release I hope because it makes certain worlds simply unusable.\n\nDeltarune HD also suffers from this issue in the open beta.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ab3bf006-1e41-4791-b109-9505b360b38d",
